03:01.690 --> 03:04.530
One day, Saitama and Genos cross paths

03:04.530 --> 03:07.950
with the hero rumored to
be the strongest on Earth.

03:09.990 --> 03:11.790
CLASS S RANK 7
KING

03:11.870 --> 03:14.370
He quickly outranked you, Master,

03:14.370 --> 03:16.330
and claimed the title of strongest hero.

03:16.620 --> 03:17.620
Oh...

03:17.920 --> 03:20.880
However, what could
he be doing around here?

03:21.170 --> 03:24.420
It's a monster!

03:26.130 --> 03:29.260
Something appears before
King, a Class S Rank 7 hero.

03:29.390 --> 03:32.310
It is the giant robot
Machine God G4.

03:34.270 --> 03:38.310
Know this. I am conducting
a live test of my combat AI systems.

03:38.440 --> 03:39.600
For data collection purposes,

03:39.600 --> 03:41.360
I expect you to fight at maximum strength.

03:41.480 --> 03:42.400
Very well.

03:42.730 --> 03:45.150
But I gotta use the john first.

03:45.650 --> 03:49.660
When I hold it in,
I can only exert 50-percent power.

03:51.200 --> 03:53.990
King appears fearless, but...

03:56.660 --> 03:58.830
I'm scared...scared damn it!

03:58.960 --> 04:00.830
I'm not strong!

04:01.170 --> 04:04.500
I'm just an unemployed,
29-year-old...

04:04.630 --> 04:05.510
I'm so screwed...

04:05.920 --> 04:07.550
I don't want to be a hero.

04:11.510 --> 04:12.350
Here it comes!

04:14.260 --> 04:17.180
Think! There's got to be a way...

04:18.140 --> 04:19.350
No, it's impossible!

04:22.110 --> 04:24.650
He is overwhelmed
by fear and runs away.

04:25.320 --> 04:29.240
Once home, he begins playing
video games to escape reality.

04:29.320 --> 04:31.360
Now this is excitement!

04:31.950 --> 04:34.120
Hi, big fella! Input your name.

04:34.410 --> 04:35.950
My name, huh?

04:36.500 --> 04:38.330
Using my real name would be lame...

04:39.580 --> 04:40.580
What then...

04:41.000 --> 04:42.380
How about "King"?

04:42.670 --> 04:44.500
No, not my hero name.

04:44.670 --> 04:47.710
If someone saw the Hot Sisters
saying, "Oh, hi there, King!" I'd...

04:48.510 --> 04:49.970
WAIT, WHAT?

04:49.970 --> 04:52.390
You're a crazy-strong
Class-S Hero, right?

04:52.640 --> 04:55.560
Saitama enters King’s home uninvited.

04:56.060 --> 05:00.100
Just as he was about
to ask him why he ran away...

05:06.070 --> 05:06.940
Oh...

05:07.150 --> 05:08.240
That startled me.

05:08.530 --> 05:11.700
You know, these threats
keep coming straight to you.

05:11.860 --> 05:14.450
Please, just give me a break!

05:15.450 --> 05:18.540
Again...and again... and again!

05:20.120 --> 05:22.420
I just happen to get caught up.

05:23.790 --> 05:25.500
All I ever do is run away.

05:26.710 --> 05:29.380
And then,
someone else beats the monster.

05:30.130 --> 05:32.430
I just find myself passing by,

05:32.680 --> 05:35.180
then people think I defeated the monster.

05:36.260 --> 05:38.770
I've never even been in a fight.

05:39.770 --> 05:44.230
I'm just a giant ball of lies!

05:44.350 --> 05:46.110
You see, actually I'm...

05:56.450 --> 05:58.030
What you said, is it true?

05:58.660 --> 06:00.620
Your reputation and record...

06:00.660 --> 06:02.080
Those are all lies?

06:02.410 --> 06:03.250
Huh?!

06:03.790 --> 06:04.620
You all right?

06:13.260 --> 06:14.510
Help! Somebody!

06:14.590 --> 06:16.090
Hey! Easy there.

06:16.760 --> 06:18.970
- I took the monster down.
- Oh... Oh...!

06:19.180 --> 06:20.310
Is your eye okay?

06:20.930 --> 06:22.640
Open it slowly.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.310
Can you see?

06:26.610 --> 06:28.060
But you're hurt...

06:28.270 --> 06:30.190
This? It's not so bad...

06:31.070 --> 06:32.780
Plus I scored a big win today!

06:37.620 --> 06:38.990
It's you...

06:43.750 --> 06:45.500
Hey! What's the matter? Hey!

06:46.330 --> 06:47.500
I'm so sorry!

06:51.460 --> 06:54.220
With monster outbreaks
rising at an alarming rate

