Right now, a crisis has begun for
mankind that we cannot overcome

07:08.020 --> 07:09.230
unless we unite as one.

07:09.520 --> 07:10.900
Our current heroes:

07:10.900 --> 07:12.860
390 Class C's

07:12.860 --> 07:14.400
101 Class B's

07:14.400 --> 07:15.990
38 Class A's

07:15.990 --> 07:17.530
and 17 from Class S

07:17.530 --> 07:19.280
are clearly not enough!

07:20.280 --> 07:24.700
Faced with a shortage of heroes,
they turn to the underworld

07:24.700 --> 07:28.250
to recruit even bounty hunters
and rogues to bolster their ranks.

07:30.170 --> 07:32.130
And among them was ...

07:33.550 --> 07:33.630
GAROU

07:33.630 --> 07:37.180
GAROU
All these nobodies put together
couldn't take me down.

07:37.180 --> 07:37.260
All these nobodies put together
couldn't take me down.

07:37.510 --> 07:38.390
Hah?

07:38.550 --> 07:40.010
Who are you?

07:40.140 --> 07:41.390
Name's Garou.

07:41.680 --> 07:43.560
I've busted tons of martial arts dojos

07:43.680 --> 07:46.520
and you could say
I've got a thing for monsters.

07:46.850 --> 07:48.270
Now what's the hold up?

07:48.400 --> 07:50.650
All of you, come at me.

07:51.060 --> 07:53.280
Let's find out who's strongest.

07:53.530 --> 07:55.070
You see, that's what I came for!

07:55.490 --> 07:57.900
I'm gonna mete out some evil.

07:58.740 --> 08:00.410
A little slaughter party!

08:01.700 --> 08:03.950
Garou, obsessed with monsters,
renders everyone present

08:04.080 --> 08:09.370
including three Class-A heroes,
completely incapacitated.

08:10.920 --> 08:16.130
Well, that should be enough for
"Garou the Monster's" spectacular debut.

08:16.590 --> 08:18.880
Today was my declaration of war.

08:19.180 --> 08:21.800
In six months, I'll be even stronger.

08:22.180 --> 08:24.060
Then I come back in
through the front door.

08:25.810 --> 08:26.850
Till then.

08:29.730 --> 08:32.860
Garou is now a wanted man
by the Hero Association...

08:34.690 --> 08:35.980
But even after that...

08:38.110 --> 08:42.870
To complete my evolution into a monster...
you're the exact prey I need.

08:43.660 --> 08:46.830
He defeats Tank-top Master,
a Class S Rank 16 hero...

08:48.580 --> 08:51.630
I've been avoiding this style,
since it reminds me of the old geezer.

08:51.630 --> 08:53.000
FIST OF FLOWING WATER
CRUSHING ROCK
