09:17.150 --> 09:19.440
Hmph. Finally down, eh?

09:19.570 --> 09:23.240
<i>Both Tank-top Master and Metal Bat
were nothing but brutes.
</i>

09:23.410 --> 09:27.580
<i>Against a human martial artist,
they have no answer.
</i>

09:28.040 --> 09:31.460
<i>Taking the Hero Association down
might be easier than I thought.
</i>

09:33.080 --> 09:37.920
Silverfang, a Class S Rank 3 hero
who was once Garou’s master

09:37.920 --> 09:40.670
suddenly expells his disciple,
Charanko.

09:41.300 --> 09:43.140
He then closes down his dojo.

09:43.430 --> 09:45.760
Have you put all
your affairs in order?

09:46.140 --> 09:49.140
I'm an old man, alone in the world.

09:49.310 --> 09:50.850
Just like you.

09:50.930 --> 09:51.100
MASTER OF FIST OF WHIRLING WIND,
SLASHING STEEL - BOMB

09:51.100 --> 09:52.600
MASTER OF FIST OF WHIRLING WIND,
SLASHING STEEL - BOMB
There you go, being ridiculous.

09:52.600 --> 09:52.730
MASTER OF FIST OF WHIRLING WIND,
SLASHING STEEL - BOMB

09:52.730 --> 09:56.190
MASTER OF FIST OF WHIRLING WIND,
SLASHING STEEL - BOMB
I said my farewells
to several hundred disciples!

09:56.570 --> 09:58.280
You cut ties to everything you have

09:58.280 --> 10:00.740
