younger brother's aid.

10:00.860 --> 10:02.950
Who could ask for more, brother?

10:03.110 --> 10:06.490
If we don't stop that Garou fellow,

10:06.490 --> 10:09.080
he'll no doubt come after
my dojo too, one day.

10:09.660 --> 10:11.040
Let's go!

10:11.500 --> 10:13.210
We must be careful, brother.

10:13.790 --> 10:17.340
No telling how strong
the wretch has become by now.

10:17.460 --> 10:20.340
He certainly concerned you
enough to call me.

10:21.840 --> 10:25.470
Unlike monsters who rely
on brute force to wreak havoc,

10:26.180 --> 10:29.810
Garou is a martial arts master
capable of defeating Class-S heroes.

10:29.810 --> 10:30.970
FIST OF FLOWING WATER
CRUSHING ROCK
