CRUSHING ROCK

10:31.310 --> 10:32.810
MASTER CHARANKO

10:32.810 --> 10:34.730
MASTER CHARANKO
Saitama became interested
in the martial arts used by Garou...

10:34.730 --> 10:36.480
Saitama became interested
in the martial arts used by Garou...

10:38.520 --> 10:40.900
I'm using this to enter
a fighting tournament.

10:41.320 --> 10:42.530
As Charanko.

10:43.740 --> 10:45.410
- Today?
- Yeah.

10:46.530 --> 10:50.370
I'm gonna go see what
this "martial arts" thing is all about.

10:53.040 --> 10:57.420
The competitors for Super Fight 22
are now entering the arena!

10:57.500 --> 10:59.380
And now, a man who boasts
unparalleled strength.

10:59.500 --> 11:01.880
Appearing after skipping
the past seven tournaments!

11:02.010 --> 11:04.670
A four-time past champion
and a legend in his own time,

11:04.760 --> 11:06.890
Suiryu, master of "Dark Corporeal Fist"!

11:08.300 --> 11:11.930
Saitama joins the tournament
to experience martial arts, but...

11:14.140 --> 11:15.350
I'm so gonna kill you—

11:15.770 --> 11:17.230
Don't touch my head!

11:17.350 --> 11:18.190
Begin!

11:19.900 --> 11:24.280
He defeats everyone with a single punch
and reaches the finals unharmed.

11:26.490 --> 11:30.450
His final opponent was
the four-time reigning champion

11:30.450 --> 11:33.290
and tournament favorite, Suiryu.

11:34.700 --> 11:37.170
What's your day job?

11:37.460 --> 11:38.460
My day job?

11:38.750 --> 11:41.420
Uh...going for walks,
defeating monsters...

11:41.880 --> 11:44.210
What? You fight monsters?

11:44.920 --> 11:47.220
It's almost as if you're doing hero stuff.

11:47.880 --> 11:49.760
They're heroes in name only.

11:50.470 --> 11:52.180
Their job is just

11:52.180 --> 11:54.930
flaunting virtue and justice
to make people feel indebted.

11:55.770 --> 12:02.190
Fine intentions, noble thoughts,
lofty morals, heroic justice...

12:02.690 --> 12:05.030
They're impurities that create boredom

12:05.030 --> 12:07.900
in the life of fun that I seek.

12:09.320 --> 12:11.120
Huh? What'd I say?

12:11.620 --> 12:14.660
I offer advice because
I see you're one of the strong, but...

12:16.290 --> 12:18.420
A clean hit!

12:19.790 --> 12:21.080
Impurities?

12:21.670 --> 12:23.210
What's that got to do with it?

12:24.340 --> 12:26.720
You're not the only one
doing what he wants to do.

12:27.220 --> 12:28.680
Suiryu, was it?

12:29.180 --> 12:31.090
Here's some advice from me.

12:33.140 --> 12:37.350
If what you're after is having fun,
don't get any stronger.

12:43.730 --> 12:45.570
Dang, I keep doing that...

12:45.940 --> 12:47.690
I almost ended it too quick again.

12:48.110 --> 12:49.110
Huh?

12:50.410 --> 12:52.950
W-What the heck happened?!

12:52.950 --> 12:53.830
Amazing!

12:53.950 --> 12:55.410
My goodness!

12:55.490 --> 12:58.080
A shocking development regarding Charanko!

12:58.410 --> 13:02.290
He's been outed as wearing a wig!

13:04.840 --> 13:08.090
Saitama is disqualified
for impersonating someone else.

13:08.720 --> 13:13.010
The tournament ends
with Suiryu’s victory.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.560
But then...

13:19.020 --> 13:20.230
All of you...

13:20.810 --> 13:22.900
...will become monsters!

13:24.940 --> 13:28.360
With savage monsters
wreaking havoc everywhere

13:28.360 --> 13:30.740
and the cities in utter chaos

13:30.950 --> 13:34.830
the sinister plot of
the Monster Association comes to light!

13:37.490 --> 13:40.040
We'll give you three days only.

13:40.120 --> 13:43.500
In that time, assemble the best
the Hero Association has

13:43.500 --> 13:45.500
and come rescue the little brat.

13:47.590 --> 13:50.220
The Monster Association issues a statement
claiming responsibility

13:50.220 --> 13:51.470
A DECLARATION OF WAR
FROM THE MONSTER ASSOCIATION

The Monster Association issues a statement
claiming responsibility

13:51.470 --> 13:53.470
A DECLARATION OF WAR
FROM THE MONSTER ASSOCIATION
and challenging the heroes.

13:53.470 --> 13:54.850
A DECLARATION OF WAR
FROM THE MONSTER ASSOCIATION

13:56.260 --> 13:58.640
Furthermore, the one
who appeared in front of

13:58.640 --> 14:00.310
the newly crowned champion
Suiryu was...

14:00.310 --> 14:03.690
I am Goketsu,
from the Monster Association.

14:03.980 --> 14:05.520
Goketsu?!

14:05.610 --> 14:08.020
The champion of the first Super Fight?!

14:09.650 --> 14:11.530
Goketsu was once human

14:11.530 --> 14:15.700
but became a monster
with immense power...

14:16.950 --> 14:18.290
You understand what that means?

14:18.290 --> 14:23.120
The Goketsu I once was is beneath
comparison to the fighter I am!

14:23.540 --> 14:27.130
Now celebrate,
for I have brought the same gift for you.

14:27.920 --> 14:29.710
You will eat these monster cells.

14:31.210 --> 14:34.180
Do so,
and you'll become monsters yourselves.

14:34.550 --> 14:38.390
One by one,
martial artists transform into monsters!

14:41.310 --> 14:45.270
And even Suiryu is scouted
by the Monster Association, but...

14:47.650 --> 14:49.270
Nah, I refuse.

14:49.400 --> 14:52.780
I'd rather die than look as ugly as you!

14:53.610 --> 14:56.110
Dark Body Flying Dragon Fist!

15:02.290 --> 15:04.330
Then die.

15:05.920 --> 15:09.000
Crushed by the unstoppable
might of Goketsu

15:09.460 --> 15:12.710
and the monsterized
martial artist Bakuzan

15:12.710 --> 15:17.390
Suiryu is plunged into utter despair.

15:20.180 --> 15:24.020
Somebody! Help me!

15:24.640 --> 15:26.020
A monster!

15:26.140 --> 15:28.940
There's a monster here!

15:29.190 --> 15:31.570
Please!
I need...a hero!

15:31.820 --> 15:33.110
Can any heroes hear me?!

15:33.240 --> 15:36.320
I'm over here! Heroes!

15:36.450 --> 15:38.820
Please! Help me!

15:39.490 --> 15:42.040
The one who appeared before Suiryu was...

15:42.240 --> 15:43.870
I heard you calling for help, Suiryu.

15:47.920 --> 15:49.580
You fought well on your own.

15:51.380 --> 15:52.840
Let me handle the rest.

16:03.060 --> 16:04.640
I know that head...

16:08.980 --> 16:11.190
Saitama takes down Bakuzan...

16:17.400 --> 16:20.320
and Goketsu with a single punch.

16:22.370 --> 16:29.080
The Super Fight brings Saitama
neither excitement nor fulfillment.

16:31.130 --> 16:34.670
He confides in King about
the curse of being too strong.

16:36.050 --> 16:39.300
Well, I'm not going to be
getting any stronger.

16:39.470 --> 16:40.340
What?

16:40.340 --> 16:42.220
I've become too strong.

16:43.140 --> 16:45.470
No matter who I fight,
I don't feel anything.

16:45.850 --> 16:47.310
I gain nothing from it.

16:47.980 --> 16:50.520
There's nothing I can learn from anyone.

16:51.900 --> 16:53.730
No matter how many monsters I defeat

16:54.440 --> 16:57.530
inside, I'm bored out of my mind.

16:57.990 --> 17:00.610
Saitama, seems to me
you're mistaking getting strong

17:00.740 --> 17:03.870
for reaching your destination.

17:04.280 --> 17:09.210
I doubt the path of becoming
a hero ends so easily.

17:09.660 --> 17:13.590
Is this a lecture?
It's not like you're some veteran hero.

17:14.420 --> 17:18.550
It's inherently wrong to
seek satisfaction from fighting.

17:19.010 --> 17:22.470
Battling with great courage
and benefiting society—

17:22.760 --> 17:24.970
Isn't that what gives
a hero's existence meaning?

17:25.180 --> 17:26.720
Philosophy from King?!

17:27.310 --> 17:31.600
In that respect, you've got a long road
to walk before you can become...

17:31.600 --> 17:33.020
...the strongest hero.

17:33.480 --> 17:34.860
That's true!

17:35.020 --> 17:36.530
And in that case

17:36.730 --> 17:39.530
to say that you've reached
the limit of your growth

17:39.690 --> 17:42.490
starts to sound
shallow and arrogant, doesn't it?

17:42.820 --> 17:44.030
King...

17:44.570 --> 17:48.620
What does it take to be
the "ultimate hero"?

17:49.200 --> 17:51.500
An unflinching sense of justice?

17:51.710 --> 17:53.790
The courage to face any hardship?

17:54.250 --> 17:56.750
Until you've found
the answer to that question

17:57.050 --> 17:59.300
how can you say
you have time to feel bored?

17:59.550 --> 18:01.300
The "ultimate hero"?

18:01.840 --> 18:04.510
<i>Should I be thinking about
what that truly means?
</i>

18:07.180 --> 18:11.520
After countless battles against
Class-S and Class-A heroes

18:11.600 --> 18:13.230
Garou is left battered
and broken.

18:16.150 --> 18:18.440
What appeared before him was...

18:22.110 --> 18:24.780
I will eliminate you.

18:26.780 --> 18:27.700
Incinerate.

18:32.830 --> 18:33.870
Genos...

18:34.670 --> 18:35.500
Bang?

18:35.920 --> 18:38.420
Would you mind letting us handle this?

18:39.300 --> 18:42.760
With Silverfang and Bomb joining Genos

18:43.180 --> 18:48.010
Garou is struck by a storm of fierce
attacks and is unable to fight back.

18:51.100 --> 18:53.020
Let's play heroes and monsters!

18:53.440 --> 18:55.560
You're gonna play too,
aren't you, Garou?

18:55.690 --> 18:57.020
C'mon, man!

18:57.310 --> 18:58.730
O-Okay.

18:59.770 --> 19:01.940
Drifting into unconsciousness

19:02.030 --> 19:05.490
Garou is flooded with bitter memories
flashing before his eyes.

19:07.740 --> 19:09.830
Justice Man Cross Chop!

19:11.330 --> 19:13.080
Why'd you dodge?

19:13.460 --> 19:14.330
Huh?

19:14.870 --> 19:18.080
Guys, hold Garou for a sec.

19:18.170 --> 19:19.420
Okay.

19:19.420 --> 19:20.300
Huh?!

19:20.300 --> 19:22.130
Justice Man Kick!

19:23.670 --> 19:26.090
Garou the Poop Monster
has been crushed!

19:27.090 --> 19:28.430
I can't take it anymore!

19:28.550 --> 19:30.510
Tat-chan, fight me!

19:30.810 --> 19:33.100
Huh? What're you talking about?

19:33.230 --> 19:35.980
I don't want to be
the monster anymore!

19:36.100 --> 19:39.940
If I win, promise me
you'll leave me alone!

19:40.980 --> 19:43.650
Guys, hold Garou for a sec.

19:45.610 --> 19:47.700
That's cheating! Let go of me!

19:47.700 --> 19:49.570
I want to fight Tat-chan!

19:53.660 --> 19:57.920
The other kids say you got violent
while you were playing.

19:57.960 --> 19:59.290
That's not what happened.

19:59.380 --> 20:01.460
Tat-chan is just popular

20:01.590 --> 20:03.300
so everyone is making me
into the bad guy.

20:03.300 --> 20:05.880
No, you did something
you shouldn't have!

20:06.130 --> 20:07.300
You have to apologize!

20:09.760 --> 20:12.560
Screw justice. And screw evil.

20:12.720 --> 20:16.140
I'm gonna be killed because
that's what everyone else wants!

20:16.640 --> 20:18.980
It's not fair! I can't stand it!

20:19.190 --> 20:20.980
It friggin' pisses me off!

20:21.310 --> 20:23.280
All I want is to make them understand!

20:25.530 --> 20:28.280
I want to strike a blow
for the little guy!

20:29.360 --> 20:34.540
Just as he tries to fight back
with his last ounce of his strength...

20:35.660 --> 20:36.910
Bang! Above you!

20:50.680 --> 20:52.010
A monster?!

20:52.010 --> 20:53.390
Hear me now!

20:54.100 --> 20:56.180
I've got Garou with me!

20:56.350 --> 20:58.440
The others I leave to you...

20:58.560 --> 21:00.650
Spiral Incineration Cannon!

21:00.940 --> 21:04.820
...Centichoro!

21:13.030 --> 21:14.530
What is this devilry?!

21:14.780 --> 21:19.960
Centichoro, a threat-level Dragon monster,
launches a fierce attack.

21:20.040 --> 21:22.630
GIANT MONSTROUS INSECT
CENTICHORO

21:29.670 --> 21:30.840
Whirling Wind...

21:34.760 --> 21:36.010
Flowing Water...

21:37.470 --> 21:39.350
Roaring Qi Rending Sky Fist!

21:49.530 --> 21:54.370
Genos, Silverfang and Bomb
deliver their finishing moves, but...

21:57.870 --> 21:59.040
Really?

21:59.250 --> 22:01.250
The damn thing just molted!

22:01.290 --> 22:03.000
That's all we did?

22:03.120 --> 22:05.210
If we can't beat it, what now?

22:05.920 --> 22:10.590
As danger closes in on the city,
the one who stopped Centichoro was...

22:11.720 --> 22:14.140
Centichoro!

22:14.590 --> 22:16.100
Listen up, noxious pest!

22:16.220 --> 22:16.680
I brought Blast, the guy you want!

22:16.680 --> 22:18.970
CENTICHORO HAS A GRUDGE
AGAINST CLASS S RANK 1 BLAST

I brought Blast, the guy you want!

22:18.970 --> 22:19.430
CENTICHORO HAS A GRUDGE
AGAINST CLASS S RANK 1 BLAST

22:19.430 --> 22:20.980
CENTICHORO HAS A GRUDGE
AGAINST CLASS S RANK 1 BLAST
Did he say Blast?!

22:20.980 --> 22:21.060
Did he say Blast?!

22:21.730 --> 22:24.440
If you want a rematch,
get over here!

22:25.060 --> 22:27.020
What's the problem? Scared?

22:27.860 --> 22:28.940
You coward!

22:35.070 --> 22:37.660
Saitama!!!

23:06.520 --> 23:07.860
Master Saitama!

23:08.690 --> 23:11.070
What do you think it is that I lack?

23:11.440 --> 23:13.030
I mean, power, right?

23:15.070 --> 23:16.320
Thank you very much!

23:17.320 --> 23:20.910
Master's battles show me the true path...

23:21.580 --> 23:23.080
He is a symbol of strength.

23:23.580 --> 23:25.120
He is what I strive to be.

23:26.000 --> 23:27.830
I will get there too.

23:33.050 --> 23:37.010
Finally,<i> One Punch Man Season 3 </i>is here!

23:39.140 --> 23:41.470
The Hero Association is taken by surprise

23:41.470 --> 23:45.020
as the Monster Association appears
and takes an executive’s child hostage!

23:45.850 --> 23:49.560
Meanwhile, Garou was taken away
by the Monster Association.

23:49.560 --> 23:51.400
What is his fate?

23:54.240 --> 23:54.650
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD TO
ONE-PUNCH MAN SEASON 3!

23:54.650 --> 23:56.990
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD TO
ONE-PUNCH MAN SEASON 3!
Get ready!
<i>One-Punch Man </i>is about to air!

23:56.990 --> 23:58.070
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD TO
ONE-PUNCH MAN SEASON 3!
Don’t miss it!

23:58.070 --> 23:59.280
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD TO
ONE-PUNCH MAN SEASON 3!

23:59.280 --> 24:00.870
PLEASE LOOK FORWARD TO
ONE-PUNCH MAN SEASON 3!
One punch!
